Package: TEMPO
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Romania's National Institute of Statistics Tempo Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Marian", "Necula", email = "marian.necula00@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Bogdan", "Oancea", email = "bogdan.oancea@gmail.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Ana Maria", "Tiru", email = "tiru.ana21@gmail.com", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Find, inspect and download statistical tables from the Romanian
    National Institute of Statistics' TEMPO Online database. Tables can be
    listed and searched in Romanian or English, their structure inspected
    before downloading, and whole tables or filtered selections retrieved
    either as data frames or as CSV files that are kept up to date between
    sessions.
License: GPL-3 | EUPL-1.1
URL: https://github.com/RProjectRomania/TEMPO
